  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the warmth of the wild and celebrate your romantic partnership with this beautiful wildlife-themed quilt from Jeminise. Perfect for cozying up indoors or staying warm during your outdoor camping and picnic adventures, this soft and durable bedding layer features a realistic illustration of a deer couple standing in a peaceful forest, making it a heartfelt gift for birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Christmas.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt with custom text input to make it a truly unique gift for your loved one.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Made from a comfortable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with a premium silk floss filling for year-round warmth and breathability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Designed to serve as a warm bed quilt, a comfortable picnic mat, a throw blanket, or a decorative cover for your sofa and backyard.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly to become even fluffier than before.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one high-quality quilt, with an option to select 2 or 4 matching pillowcases during customization.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife, Romance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60'x70'), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
